# PinPinWish - Local & Personal Configuration
# PinPinWish runs 100% locally with SQLite out of the box. No keys required for local automatic mode.

# Optional: Put SQLite, images and the browser profile in another local folder.
# PINPINWISH_DATA_DIR=C:\Users\Usuario\Documents\PinPinWishData

# Advanced: override only the SQLite file.
# SQLITE_DATABASE_PATH=C:\Users\Usuario\Documents\PinPinWishData\pinpinwish.db

# Optional: Port configuration
# PORT=3000
